    "ls|LS16_S10_U_293": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF YOUTH AFFAIRS AND SPORTS \n (DEPARTMENT OF SPORTS) \n \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.293 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 17.11.2016 \n \nDevelopment of Sports \n293. SHRI BHAGWANTH KHUBA:  \n Will the Minister of YOUTH AFFAIRS AND SPORTS ; be pleased to \nstate:  \n(a)  the measures taken/being taken by the Government to develop \nthe sports and sports institutions including Sports Authority of India \n(SAI) in the country;  \n(b)  the details of funds provided by the Union Government to various \nStates/UTs for development of sports/infrastructure during each of the \nlast three years and the current year, State/UT-wise;  \n(c)  whether the Government proposes to set up any indoor sports \nstadiums across the country including Karnataka; and  \n(d)  if so, the details thereof ? \nANSWER \n \nMINISTER OF STATE (INDEPENDENT CHARGE) FOR YOUTH AFFAIRS \nAND SPORTS \n(SHRI VIJAY GOEL) \n \n(a)     Development of sports and sports institutions under the Ministry \nof Youth Affairs & Sports is an on -going process.  Measures are taken  \nfrom time to time for this purpose.  Major steps taken recently are \nformulation of ‘Khelo India’  programme  which, inter-alia, provides  for \n\nholding of annual sports competitions, sports talent identification and \ncreation of sports infrastructure.   \n A special package of Rs.200 crore  for development of sports \ninfrastructure / facilities in Jammu & Kashmir has been prepared.  \n It has been decided to set up  a National Sports University in \nManipur.   \n As far as Sports Authority India is concerned, major steps \ninclude setting up of academies in individual sports disciplines.  \n(b)  Details are at the Annexure \n( c)  No, Madam.  \n(d)  Not Applicable.  \n*** \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\nANNEXURE \nANNEXURE REFERED IN REPLY TO PART ( b) OF LOK SABHA UNSTARRED QUESTION \nNO.293 FOR 1 7.11.2016 REGARDING DEVELOPMENT OF SPORTS  ASKED BY SHRI \nBHAGWANTH KHUBA, MP. \