\n    821.893 832.7297 1654.6227 \n \n ",
    "ls|LS16_S10_U_303": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA\nMINISTRY OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT\nDEPARTMENT OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT\nLOK SABHA\nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 303\nTO BE ANSWERED ON 17.11.2016\nTIE UP OF RURAL BAZAAR WITH RETAIL CHAINS\n303. SHRI ANOOP MISHRA:\nWill the Minister of RURAL DEVELOPMENT be pleased to state:\n(a) whether the Government proposes to tie up rural bazaar with Indian and foreign retail\nchains to co-market products made in rural areas;\n(b) if so, the details thereof;\n(c) whether the Government proposes to set up special stores in the cities to market the\nproducts made by Self-Help Groups; and\n(d) if so, the details thereof?\nANSWER\nMINISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF RURAL DEVELOPMENT\n(SHRI RAM KRIPAL YADAV)\n(a)&(b): No, Sir.\n(c)&(d): The Ministry of Rural Development has hired a Gallery at Rajiv Gandhi\nHandicrafts Bhavan, Baba Kharak Singh Marg, New Delhi from Development Commissioner\n(Handicrafts), Ministry of Textiles for display and sale of products of Self Help Groups, the\nmanagement of which has been recently handed over to CAPART, an autonomous body\nfunctioning under the aegis of this Ministry.\n*****",
