    "ls|LS16_S10_U_486": "Government of India\n \nMinistry of Finance\n \nDepartment of Revenue\n \n \nLOK SABHA\n \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. \n486\n \nTO BE ANSWERED ON FRIDAY, NOVEMBER 18\n, 2016\n \nKARTIKA 27\n, 1938 \n(SAKA)\n \n \nDEVOLITION OF FUNDS\n \n \n640: \nSHRI RABINDRA KUMAR JENA\n:\n \n \n         \nWill the Minister of FINANCE be pleased to state:\n \n \n(a)\n \nthe detail of contribution of funds/revenue by States/UTs to the central pool of funds, during the last three years, State/UT\n-\nwise; \n \n \n(b)\n \nthe total central funds devolved/and utilized by the States/UTs during the last three years, State/UT\n-\nwise; \n \n \n(c)\n \nwhether the \nGovernment gives weightage to performance and utilization while devolving funds to States/UTs; and \n \n \n(d)     if so, the details thereof and the number of such States/UTs granted performance incentives during the last three yea\nr, State/UTs\n-\nwise?\n \n \nANSWER\n \nMIN\nISTER OF STATE IN THE MINISTRY OF FINANCE\n \n(SANTOSH KUMAR GANGWAR)\n \n \n(a):\n \nDirect Tax\n \n \nThe details of States and U.T wise break up of Net collection of direct taxes during the last three years is as per Annexure \nA.\n \n \nIndirect Tax \n \n \nThe Indirect taxes collected\n \nduring the last three years and the current year (April\n-\nSeptember) is as under:\n-\n \n\n \nFinancial Year\n \nTotal (Customs, Central Excise & Service \nTax)\n \n2013\n-\n14\n \n4,97,060\n \n2014\n-\n15\n \n5,44,772\n \n2015\n-\n16(P)\n \n7,08,883\n \n2016\n-\n17 (April\n-\nSept) (P)\n \n4,85,850\n \n       \n(P)\n-\n \nProvisional\n \n \n(b): The details of State\n-\nwise releases in respect of (i) Share of Central Taxes and Duties (ii) NSSF loans for last 3 years are enclosed as Annexure B\n \n& C.  \n \n \n       \nInformation about Release of Central Assistance for State Plan is placed at \nAnnexure D.\n \n \n(c) & (d): Devolution of funds from Central Pool of taxes are done as per the recommendations made by Finance Commission(s).\